+
+## Bulk import
+
+`importTasks(list, text)` adds tasks from text with one task per line, as `title;priority;tags`, for
+example `Renew the insurance;high;admin money`. The priority may be empty (normal), tags are separated by
+spaces, and blank lines are skipped. It returns `{ imported, rejected }`, where each rejected line is
+`{ line, reason }` with `line` counting from 1; a rejected line does not stop the others.
